		"description": "<p>Calling the power of the storm to your weapon, you fling yourself across the battlefield and drag lightning from the sky down onto your foes. As an action, teleport up to 60ft to an unoccupied space you can see. All enemies within 10ft of the target area must make a Constitution saving throw or take lightning damage as if hit by your weapon and be pushed back 15ft. On a successful save they take half damage and are pushed 5ft.</p>",
